Description:The opponent controls Enemy of the Guildpact (protection from multicolored) and Hill Giant and is at 20 life. You have Solar Blaze and Shock in hand and R R R W W floating. End the turn with both creatures in the opponent's graveyard and the opponent at 18 life.
